This licence covers the code in this repository.

It does not cover the filings this code reads. Those are the registrants' own
documents, published on SEC EDGAR, and are not works of the US Government --
with one exception: a comment letter written by SEC staff (form type UPLOAD) is
a US Government work under 17 U.S.C. 105. A company's reply (CORRESP) is not.

The facts drawn from filings -- dates, item codes, disclosure states -- are not
copyrightable. Quoted passages are short excerpts reproduced with a link to the
source document.
